    "scope": "Inside boundary: Strait of Hormuz maritime control and traffic patterns; Iran‑Oman negotiations and Iranian legislative/diplomatic moves; Gulf state military and diplomatic responses; commercial actors (tankers, charterers, oil majors, refiners), insurers/reinsurers, freight markets; short‑term oil, fuel and gas market pricing and flows; sanctions and enforcement actions; information and media flows shaping market expectations.",
